{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Baby Rhythm 是一款節奏溫和、操作簡單的嬰兒記錄工具，適合希望輕鬆掌握寶寶日常作息的新手父母。你可以記下餵奶、小睡、夜間睡眠、尿片與重要里程碑，並透過溫和的摘要慢慢看出規律，不必跟從死板時間表。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>安靜簡單的育兒記錄</h2>\n<p>Baby Rhythm 讓你集中記錄餵奶、日間小睡、晚間睡眠與醒來時間，也可記下尿片狀況與重要里程碑，並查看每日摘要與每週平均值。所有資料只儲存在裝置本機，沒有廣告、內購或訂閱，也不會分享或追蹤任何數據。介面乾淨中性，不強迫你跟隨固定時間表，只協助你慢慢看出寶寶的生活規律。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-225-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-226-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-227-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-228-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-229-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：My Baby Rhythm</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T07:00:55.116423+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T06:53:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T08:18:07.004506+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:57:44.317996+00:00","content_hash":"9af96cb2a650f18388c6b4f6529cf08dbbc0bd5327f02baaeb9ad99ab1bf93f1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}